WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 077. A RULE CHANGES. WHAT MOVES NEXT?. One fictional regulatory notice enters an inspectable consequence system.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
SEND THE CHANGE THROUGH THE GRAPH. CLAUSE → ACTOR → OBLIGATION → WORKFLOW. The source record connects to affected roles, triggered work, dependencies, and retained date context.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
KEEP TIME HONEST. KNOWN DATE · NULL DATE · NO IMPUTATION. An unknown effective date stays unknown, and a missing deadline is never calculated or calendared.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
SURFACE THE OPEN WORK. RISKS UNASSESSED · OPPORTUNITIES · QUESTIONS. The trace identifies what needs inspection without predicting liability, enforcement, causation, or outcomes.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
BOUND THE RESULT. A CONSEQUENCE LINE IS NOT LEGAL ADVICE. Synthetic changes only; no current law, compliance, real deadline, rights, liability, enforcement, causation, or outcome determination.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. TRACE THE CONSEQUENCE. KEEP THE CLAIM NARROW.. CHANGE INTELLIGENCE IMPROVES WHEN SOURCE, CLAUSE, ACTOR, OBLIGATION, TIMELINE, DEPENDENCY, RISK, OPPORTUNITY, UNKNOWN, AND LIMIT REMAIN CONNECTED.

